# Normalise line endings so the repo stays identical across Windows, macOS,
# Linux, and the GitHub web editor.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: update-prices.yml carries a bash `run`
# block, and CRLF committed from Windows would leave a trailing \r on every
# line of that script when it runs on an Ubuntu runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
